<div id="A1.SS5.SSS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS5.SSS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">All four omnibus nulls are rejected. More pairwise contrasts are significant
for coverage than utilization on both benchmarks (20 versus 7 on
MemoryAgentBench and 19 versus 17 on MEME), and the observed coverage range is
larger in each case. The uncertainty analysis supports coverage as the
broader cross-system bottleneck, with significant variation in utilization
as well.</p>
</div>
