<section id="A1.SS5.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic ltx_title_subsubsection">A.5.2. Complete-store evaluation</h4>

<section id="A1.SS5.SSS2.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Evaluation scope.</h5>

<div id="A1.SS5.SSS2.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS5.SSS2.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The diagnostic covers the same 100 MEME episodes with 32k distractor tokens
and 1,188 question IDs in every condition: 494 before-phase and
694 after-phase questions. Native (<math id="A1.SS5.SSS2.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>) uses the designated system’s
ordinary retrieval and reader path. Complete-store (<math id="A1.SS5.SSS2.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>C</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C</annotation></semantics></math>) replaces
native retrieval with privileged selection over the exported persisted
representations, subject to the phase/provenance rules in
Appendix <a href="#A3.SS5" title="C.5. Complete-store and oracle evaluations ‣ Appendix C Diagnostic Procedures and Statistical Methods ‣ Is Complex Agentic Memory Always Needed? Naive RAG Is Stronger Than We Thought" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.5</span></a>, and adds a task-aware reader policy.
Raw evidence (<math id="A1.SS5.SSS2.Px1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>R</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R</annotation></semantics></math>) selects original
support sessions with the same gold signals and task policy.
All three columns use GPT-4o-mini answers; Overall is the macro-average
of the six after-phase task accuracies, including the benchmark’s
before-pass gate for Del, Cas, and Abs.
The repeated <math id="A1.SS5.SSS2.Px1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>R</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R</annotation></semantics></math> column reports one shared raw-evidence run.</p>
</div>
