<section id="A5.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_subsection">E.3. Synthesis</h3>

<div id="A5.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Several reviewed baselines have concrete configuration bottlenecks:
Nemori and RecMem use overly large chunks, while Mem0, Memobase’s public
RAG configuration, RecMem, Memora, and BEAM restrict retrieval to too few
evidence locations. Addressing these concerns requires changing chunk size
and retrieval depth alongside ranking. Other evaluations already explore
granularity and depth more
extensively, making reranking a distinct remaining control.
These diagnoses motivate joint chunk-size and retrieval-depth tuning under
matched budgets. Quantifying their contribution to published score gaps
requires controlled reruns.</p>
</div>
