message. For examples with an annotated question date, the
reader receives the following date-aware query in place of
{question} in that shared template.
{raw_question} below denotes the original benchmark question.
If no question date is present, the original question is used directly.
This standalone configuration differs from MemoryAgentBench’s
LongMemEval source (prompt in Appendix <a href="#A7.SS7" title="G.7. MemoryAgentBench reader ‣ Appendix G Prompt Templates ‣ Is Complex Agentic Memory Always Needed? Naive RAG Is Stronger Than We Thought" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">G.7</span></a>).</p>
