<p id="A7.SS6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The main MEME evaluation uses the following official short-answer
prompt, sent as one user message without
a separate system message. The context contains the evidence available
at the corresponding evaluation phase. This is the standard answer
prompt; the value-free dependency-validity control for Abs is a
separate oracle condition (Appendix <a href="#A7.SS11" title="G.11. Dependency-validity control ‣ Appendix G Prompt Templates ‣ Is Complex Agentic Memory Always Needed? Naive RAG Is Stronger Than We Thought" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">G.11</span></a>).
