Appendix <a href="#A7.SS12" title="G.12. Complete-store task policy ‣ Appendix G Prompt Templates ‣ Is Complex Agentic Memory Always Needed? Naive RAG Is Stronger Than We Thought" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">G.12</span></a> to its selected context.</p>
