<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Evidence requirements.</h5>

<div id="A7.SS10.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS10.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The placeholder {contract_json} is a JSON object serialized
with two-space indentation. Its fields are shown below; braced
placeholders are replaced by JSON strings or arrays.
Targets and the upstream entity come from the matching annotated MEME
task. History values come from the question’s annotated entity values;
old/new target values and upstream before/after values come from episode
entity metadata. Value lists are flattened and deduplicated in order.
These evidence criteria are supplied only to the judge.</p>
