<div id="A7.SS12.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS12.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In the complete-store diagnostic, the reader receives
the selected evidence followed by a newline and the policy block below,
inside {context} of the standard MEME reader prompt.
